{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Hecke.ChannelSwapSplitting","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Hecke.ChannelSwapSplitting","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Algebra.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Module.LinearMap.Defs","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Ring"],"declarations":4,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.ChannelSwapSplitting.tr_eq_of_tr_swap_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.ChannelSwapSplitting.tr_eq_of_tr_swap_eq","kind":"theorem","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/ChannelSwapSplitting.lean#L57-L68","doc":"**Converse.**  Over a domain, when the letters are independent (`a₁ b₂ ≠ a₂ b₁`), the two\nchannels have the same trace only if the carriers have the same trace. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.ChannelSwapSplitting.tr_swap_eq_of_tr_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.ChannelSwapSplitting.tr_swap_eq_of_tr_eq","kind":"theorem","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/ChannelSwapSplitting.lean#L48-L55","doc":"**No splitting from equal-trace carriers.**  If the two carriers have the same trace, the\ntwo channels have the same trace, whatever the letters. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.ChannelSwapSplitting.tr_swap_sub","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.ChannelSwapSplitting.tr_swap_sub","kind":"theorem","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/ChannelSwapSplitting.lean#L36-L46","doc":"**Channel-swap splitting.**  For a trace `tr`, exchanging the two carriers changes the\ntrace of a product of two degree-one letters by `(a₁ b₂ - a₂ b₁) (tr c₂ - tr c₁)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.ChannelSwapSplitting.letter","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.ChannelSwapSplitting.letter","kind":"def","line":33,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/ChannelSwapSplitting.lean#L33-L34","doc":"A letter of degree at most one in a carrier `c`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}